* 0.1.0 (2026-07-24)

  This is the first release under the tamatebako/fmem fork. It modernizes
  the build system, adds GitHub Actions CI, and adds pkg-config / CMake
  package config / vcpkg packaging.

  Build and packaging:
  - Modernized CMake build (minimum 3.16) with declared project version.
  - Added pkg-config template (fmem.pc.in).
  - Added CMake package config (fmemConfig.cmake) so downstream projects
    can use find_package(fmem).
  - Added vcpkg manifest and port overlay.
  - Replaced legacy Travis CI and AppVeyor configs with GitHub Actions.

  New features:
  - None in this release; behavior is unchanged from Snaipe/fmem.
